Baby, carry on

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:14.190
Ashita no kaze fuku goro ni

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:20.196
Waratte yo namaikina mama de ite

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.417
Akireru hodo

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:34.798
Gamushara ni ikiteta mutekina jidai

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:42.440
Totsuzen ni kuzureru yoru
mo aru keredo

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:49.372
Kuchibiru natsukashii melody

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:56.565
Koronda kizu ni ase ga shimiru

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.601
Baby, carry on

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:03.028
Mukai kaze fuku asa mo

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:09.712
Waratte yo tsuki mo itsuka muite kuru

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.714
Someday your journey will come

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:16.952
Kiseki hitotsu kurai okoseru yo

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:19.688
Sono hi made

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:25.651
Don't you surrender! Angel Blue!

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:46.364
Lord our Father in Heaven,

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.018
| have betrayed the trust of
the guests in my inn

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.020
by stealing money from their wallets.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:54.757
| have taken their money to feed my
uncontrollable gambling habit.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.259
| am a weak and foolish man.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:02:00.617
| beg your forgiveness on
my unworthy soul.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.580
Please, Lord, please.

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:09.371
It is courageous of you to confess
your sins, Pierre.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.373
If you want your sins to be absolved,

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.593
you must seek enlightenment
and do good deeds.

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:18.899
Only then will the Good Lord be
willing to forgive your sins.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.941
Bless you, Sister Romina.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:48.101
EIf.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.014
EIf.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:52.314
Yep, it's an elf.
EIf.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:53.601
Yep, it's an elf.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.508
That's an elf all right.

00:02:57.944 --> 00:02:59.708
And you are a dog with a mustache.

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:01.857
One of these days...

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:01.924
Now, now.
One of these days...

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:03.459
Now, now.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.127
Wait a minute.

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:08.230
Something's not right.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.666
It's only been thirty seconds
since the episode title

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.158
and we've already found an elf.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:18.073
Maybe not. Why can't it be
easy for a change?

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:19.587
This is a fantasy series after all.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.159
Leave this to me. I'll have
her stripped in no time.

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:29.051
What's up, old man?

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:30.519
Old man?

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:32.788
Who are you calling "old man"?!

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:34.623
You are totally an old man.

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:37.293
Anyone over eighteen should check
themselves into a nursing home.

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:38.842
I'll kill her!

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:41.954
Stay calm.

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:47.459
My friends and I need to get back to
Japan, so take off your clothes.

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:53.298
| don't get it.

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:56.834
Who cares what you get? Here we go.

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:59.171
Forgive me for stripping you!

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:03.176
Hey, did you say something?

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:12.211
What's your problem? You must
be senile or something.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.388
Forgive me for stripping you!

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:26.141
That was my slickest move, and she
still slipped past me. She's good.

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:29.760
You're an annoying old man, but it's
pretty funny when you get mad.

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.184
Killl Killl Kill! Kill!

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.253
Crush! Crush! Crush! Crush!

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:40.923
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:41.557
What?

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:42.524
What is it?
What?

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:43.058
What is it?
Look closely.

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:44.015
Look closely.

00:04:49.589 --> 00:04:51.921
Junpei! Junpei, stop!

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:57.973
How the hell did that happen?

00:04:57.997 --> 00:05:00.364
Junpei, look at her!

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:03.603
What's going on here?

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.782
| got it! She's a spiritual entity!

00:05:06.806 --> 00:05:07.883
A spiritual what?

00:05:07.907 --> 00:05:08.284
Simply put, she's a ghost.
A spiritual what?

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.485
Simply put, she's a ghost.

00:05:09.509 --> 00:05:10.977
A ghost?!

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:19.862
What are you people doing?

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:22.064
Us? We're just...

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:26.435
| was watching you. How dare you
swing your fists at the dead?

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:29.326
It not only violates the sanctity of life,
but is also a sin against Almighty God.

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:32.424
| didn't realize what I was doing.

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:35.163
Emmy, you have only yourself to blame.

00:05:35.535 --> 00:05:37.313
Isn't it about time you gave up
this material world

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:39.704
and journeyed to the life hereafter?

00:05:40.306 --> 00:05:41.933
You've got to be kidding!

00:05:43.076 --> 00:05:44.544
Emmy!

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:56.031
Wow! She's a real ghost.

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:58.581
| guess that's why you
couldn't undress her.

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:06.925
Astral projection?!

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:11.714
Yes, astral projection. It's the only
way to undress that elf.

00:06:11.738 --> 00:06:14.450
What the hell is astral projection?

00:06:14.474 --> 00:06:17.019
Why do you get worked up over
things you don't understand?

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:18.520
Astral projection is the method

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:21.690
by which the spirit of a person is
separated from their physical body.

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:25.260
In other words, we become ghosts.

00:06:25.284 --> 00:06:28.549
But weren't you afraid of ghosts
in the last episode?

00:06:28.955 --> 00:06:30.766
That was then, this is now.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.283
Boy, I hate fantasy shows.

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:37.573
All right! That's enough of that!

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:39.541
Will we be able to perform
this astral projection?

00:06:39.565 --> 00:06:41.043
Naturally!

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:43.078
Astral projection is mere child's play
for someone with my abilities.

00:06:43.102 --> 00:06:46.515
| am Celcia Marikhreel! The greatest
sorceress of her time!

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:47.916
Or have you forgotten?

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.016
Yeah, whatever. Just make sure that you don't
turn us into ghosts Or have you forgotten?

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:51.887
Yeah, whatever. Just make sure that
you don't turn us into ghosts

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.989
