ridiculous spells!

00:06:54.013 --> 00:06:55.491
Got it, you hairy-lipped mutt?

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:57.493
Aw, you ruined my surprise.

00:06:57.517 --> 00:07:00.896
That's exactly the method I had
in mind for you, Junpei.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.866
You squat little runt!
You want a piece of me?

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.667
No, I can handle the whole thing!

00:07:05.691 --> 00:07:07.436
Come on! Knock it off, you two!

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.827
