spell fragments right now!

00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:16.902
Okay, Mike, make sure no one fools
with our bodies while we're gone.

00:07:19.338 --> 00:07:22.535
Is everybody ready? There's no
point in putting this off.

00:07:26.512 --> 00:07:29.024
| am the keeper of the light.

00:07:29.048 --> 00:07:32.177
| command thee, Gods of Antiquity, in
the name of our sacred covenant.

00:07:36.355 --> 00:07:38.467
Souls, hear my voice!

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:40.035
Abandon your tired shells

00:07:40.059 --> 00:07:41.891
and journey forth into the limitless
realm of the sky!

00:07:42.261 --> 00:07:43.729
Obey!

00:07:52.071 --> 00:07:52.881
Did it work?

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:53.549
| don't feel any different.
Did it work?

00:07:53.573 --> 00:07:55.284
| don't feel any different.

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:59.142
Of course not, your physical body is
only a small part of who you are.

00:08:00.847 --> 00:08:01.890
Celcial

00:08:01.914 --> 00:08:02.324
<i>What? Why are you surprised?
Celcia!</i>

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:05.127
What? Why are you surprised?

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:07.463
This is my true form, after all.

00:08:07.487 --> 00:08:10.466
Yeah, but it's much funnier when
you're a talking dog.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.201
What was that, Junpei?

00:08:12.225 --> 00:08:13.869
Oh, nothing.

00:08:13.893 --> 00:08:17.625
All right! Now we are spiritual
entities just like Emmy.

00:08:19.298 --> 00:08:23.145
Oh, yeah! Now, I'll be able
to get my hands on her.

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:24.780
Junpei!

00:08:24.804 --> 00:08:26.738
