skills on my rear!

00:08:31.611 --> 00:08:33.079
Come back here!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.190
What?!

00:08:35.214 --> 00:08:35.557
Oh, my!
What?!

00:08:35.581 --> 00:08:36.673
Oh, my!

00:08:37.316 --> 00:08:38.841
| said come back here!

00:08:40.386 --> 00:08:41.897
| don't want to.

00:08:41.921 --> 00:08:42.931
You little brat!

00:08:42.955 --> 00:08:45.834
You said you'd take your clothes off
if you lost that game of badminton!

00:08:45.858 --> 00:08:47.102
I'm too embarrassed.

00:08:47.126 --> 00:08:47.336
Then you said you'd take them off if you
lost the staring game! I'm too embarrassed.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.372
Then you said you'd take them off
if you lost the staring game!

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:52.007
I'm too embarrassed.

00:08:52.031 --> 00:08:53.408
How about a game of Simon Says?

00:08:53.432 --> 00:08:53.509
I'm too embarrassed.
How about a game of Simon Says?

00:08:53.533 --> 00:08:54.910
I'm too embarrassed.

00:08:54.934 --> 00:08:56.629
Catch you later. Bye-bye!

00:09:03.009 --> 00:09:05.171
That girl must have been a marathon
runner in her first life.

00:09:06.279 --> 00:09:07.789
Are you okay, Junpei?

00:09:07.813 --> 00:09:09.458
| can't believe she outran Junpei.

00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:12.895
We're going to have to come up with
a cunning plan to catch her.

00:09:12.919 --> 00:09:14.663
Don't you worry.

00:09:14.687 --> 00:09:17.315
