00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:42.169
Hello? When would you like
me to bring your supper?

00:09:42.682 --> 00:09:44.150
Guests?

00:09:51.757 --> 00:09:53.225
My guests!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.228
She's cold.

00:09:57.196 --> 00:09:59.528
She's cold too! Even the dog!

00:10:00.866 --> 00:10:02.698
They're all dead!

00:10:10.676 --> 00:10:12.735
This is your cunning plan?

00:10:13.613 --> 00:10:15.324
She's been running for a long time.

00:10:15.348 --> 00:10:18.160
She'll be covered in sweat, and
she'll want to come in here.

00:10:18.184 --> 00:10:20.662
I've never heard of a ghost who sweats.

00:10:20.686 --> 00:10:21.797
That doesn't matter!

00:10:21.821 --> 00:10:25.467
Ghosts are creatures of habit.
Habits are stronger than death.

00:10:25.491 --> 00:10:29.404
If she's sweaty, she'll go to a bathhouse
