00:11:26.686 --> 00:11:30.098
This is why I hate fantasy shows!

00:11:30.122 --> 00:11:34.081
Didn't your parents teach you
not to play with your food?

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.428
Forgive me for stripping you!

00:11:40.066 --> 00:11:42.944
| can't believe she didn't
have a spell fragment.

00:11:42.968 --> 00:11:45.781
After all the trouble we went to.

00:11:45.805 --> 00:11:49.384
But we solved that caper in record time.

00:11:49.408 --> 00:11:50.886
Let's use the rest of the episode

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.020
to put on a freak show with our dopey
dog as the main attraction.

00:11:52.044 --> 00:11:52.387
Very funny! to put on a freak show
with our dopey dog as the main attraction.

00:11:52.411 --> 00:11:53.503
Very funny!

00:12:02.655 --> 00:12:03.899
This can't be.

00:12:03.923 --> 00:12:04.132
Where? Where is it? What
happened to my body?! This can't be.

00:12:04.156 --> 00:12:06.668
Where? Where is it? What
happened to my body?!

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:08.182
What's going on here?

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:16.678
Mike is gone, dammit!

00:12:16.702 --> 00:12:18.180
We should have known better

00:12:18.204 --> 00:12:20.248
than to trust our bodies to that
meowing hunk of scrap metal!

00:12:20.272 --> 00:12:22.250
It's hard to believe that
bodies without souls

00:12:22.274 --> 00:12:24.152
could just get up and leave
on their own.

00:12:24.176 --> 00:12:26.988
Someone must have taken them.

00:12:27.012 --> 00:12:29.858
Who would do that? A burglar?

00:12:29.882 --> 00:12:34.996
No, not that. A burglar would take the
valuables and leave the bodies.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:39.301
That's true. A body without a soul
is the same as a corpse.

00:12:39.325 --> 00:12:42.904
No one would want to steal
something like that.

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:44.396
Than who took them?

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.898
Let's calm down and think clearly.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:51.994
Ritsuko, what would you do if you
had found our bodies?

00:12:53.038 --> 00:12:56.531
Well, I'd probably assume that
they were dead bodies.

00:12:57.543 --> 00:12:58.386
What then?

00:12:58.410 --> 00:12:59.020
| would get freaked out
and call a doctor. What then?

00:12:59.044 --> 00:13:00.842
| would get freaked out
and call a doctor.

00:13:01.781 --> 00:13:04.526
What would you do if the doctor
told you they were dead?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.695
If I was in Japan and no one
else would claim them,

00:13:06.719 --> 00:13:09.231
| would give them a proper funeral.

00:13:09.255 --> 00:13:10.723
But in this world...

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:12.768
The church!

00:13:12.792 --> 00:13:14.260
Exactly.

00:13:27.573 --> 00:13:32.670
