brought this about.

00:13:33.546 --> 00:13:37.092
Still, I didn't expect them all to be
punished at the same time.

00:13:37.116 --> 00:13:39.642
May God have mercy on their souls.

00:13:41.587 --> 00:13:45.700
Pierre, it is kind of you to take care
of the funeral arrangements.

00:13:45.724 --> 00:13:49.704
Not at all. Any child of God would
have done the same.

00:13:49.728 --> 00:13:51.907
Even though they were terrible sinners,

00:13:51.931 --> 00:13:53.775
we are all equal in the sight of God.

00:13:53.799 --> 00:13:57.679
We must send them off to meet the
Creator in a proper manner.

00:13:57.703 --> 00:13:59.181
It's the least we can do

00:13:59.205 --> 00:14:03.972
for those the Lord has chosen to
judge before they could repent.

00:14:04.443 --> 00:14:05.911
| will do so.

00:14:06.312 --> 00:14:10.909
Let us pray, we will ask that peace
be granted to their eternal souls.

00:14:11.617 --> 00:14:13.085
Yes, Sister.

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.832
<i>Ms. Airil Ms. Celcia!</i>

00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:18.200
Did you have any luck, Ritsuko?

00:14:18.224 --> 00:14:18.333
None. How about you?
Did you have any luck, Ritsuko?

00:14:18.357 --> 00:14:20.969
None. How about you?

00:14:20.993 --> 00:14:25.240
No luck, either. This town must have
a church, but where is it?

00:14:25.264 --> 00:14:29.792
Damn! How can you ask for directions
