| hate to admit it,

00:16:30.189 --> 00:16:32.920
but I think that smoke has something to
do with our sudden heat stroke.

00:16:34.994 --> 00:16:38.073
Oh, no! We'll never get there in time!

00:16:38.097 --> 00:16:39.674
You're right.

00:16:39.698 --> 00:16:42.677
Wait! Possession! We need to
possess something fast!

00:16:42.701 --> 00:16:44.913
Possession? What are you
talking about?

00:16:44.937 --> 00:16:48.396
Spiritual beings can possess inanimate
objects, like Mike did.

00:16:48.841 --> 00:16:51.242
| get it. I have an idea.

00:16:55.514 --> 00:16:59.160
| can't believe it. I feel like
I'm floating on air.

00:16:59.184 --> 00:17:01.676
| do too, Lucy!

00:17:14.233 --> 00:17:16.099
Is there something wrong, Sister?

00:17:16.635 --> 00:17:18.694
